# `FOUND-13` — the generated clients are build outputs, reproducible from
# `packages/contracts/openapi.json`. A hand-committed copy becomes the version
# everyone actually uses and drifts from the server silently. `openapi.json`
# itself *is* committed: it is the baseline an API diff is taken against.
packages/contracts/ts/
packages/contracts/dart/
